  unit: { count: 30, covers: "The verdicts that read the probes beside them. The not-decrypting remedy defers to a certificate probe that reads trusted and sends no one back to the certificate step, and a trusted certificate changes no other traffic reading's words (R18). The end credits this machine only for trust trusted and proxy ours, across seven probe pairs (R17). The reversal's line names the certificate only where it reads trusted (R14). The existing verdict tests still run beside them." }
  integration: { count: 172, covers: "The screen's contract at render. Onboarding: each task holds its own route under the one act, which leads task 1, and nothing renders between tasks. On macOS and Windows, the four readings: P8 inverted (certificate trusted, proxy off gives no one act, the proxy task's own action and steps, no certificate install step anywhere); the mirror opens the certificate's steps in task 1 with the reversal in task 2; both done leaves no install step or action and each way back shut. A failed set-up, set-proxy or unset opens the route its note names, a dismissed prompt opens nothing, and the button's line stays above what happened. The reversal sits in task 2, on the Simulator too, appears on resolve before the re-read, and comes back when the proxy is set again after it was taken off. The end names no device while a probe reads not done; the remedy defers to a trusted certificate. The permanent state matrix: host (4) x platform (3) x trust (3) x proxy (4) x traffic (3) at rest and every offered action in every outcome, 2017 states, each flattened to an outline and judged by named place, time and truth rules; 340 of them red against the pre-WU screen. App: a real set-up failure leaves task 1's route open with the OS's words, and the save step is reached through task 1's route." }
  e2e: { waived: "Waived at WU level as the epic plan rules for R12: the per-half layout turns on the real machine's trust store and proxy, which a hermetic run cannot set, so the readings are pinned at Onboarding level and in the matrix. The walkthrough was re-run through the real Tauri window as evidence: green at 9ac541b with 24 reels and 144 chapters, the R12-R18 chapters showing the new layout. The epic's e2e is W6's." }
